  "notes": [
    "Short, Recurve, Flat and Longbow material progression is intentionally separate from the forged melee weapon-part system.",
    "All non-wood ranged bows are crafted in a vanilla crafting table from the matching wooden bow plus two units of the normal, unheated material.",
    "Wooden Short, Recurve and Flat bows are crafted directly from planks, wooden rods, a simple handle and string.",
    "Tin, Bronze, Electrum, Lead, Nickel, Invar, Constantan, Platinum and Aluminum variants are intentionally excluded.",
